      "raw": "FWIW, [episodes 5](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HaMzom-mP3I) and [6](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o--OXFb6q6w) dropped earlier today.  The Chairman is still dead/missing, the gang war in Rook City is going strong, and our heroes are caught up in the mess.  I think issue 6 wraps things up but haven't listened to it yet, so there may be more to come.  Or not.\n\nEDIT:  Nope, session 6 leaves things hanging and they apparently plan another Collection worth of play after a break for another system.  Hopefully their system mastery improves some by then.  They spent 12+ hours playing on-mike and had a less firm grasp on things than some first-timers I've run 3-hour demos for. \n\nIs it weird that this is the third supers game I've watched/played in this year featuring a hero named Camazotz?  Who knew Mayan bat gods were so trendy?  It's probably Bruce Wayne's fault somehow.\n\nI refuse to blame Kirk Langstrom, he takes the heat for this sort of thing way too often already.",
